// @name: 9. Sub-grammars
// @tagline: Separate structure from material with -----
// @language: bpscript
// @outputs: audio
// @level: didactic
// @tags: tutorial
// @order: 9
//
// Tutorial 9 — Sub-grammars
//
// ----- separates sub-grammars.
// Each sub-grammar is applied in order.
// Sub-grammar 1 builds the structure.
// Sub-grammar 2 fills in the details.
//
// @mode:X sets the derivation type for a sub-grammar block.
// It persists until overridden.

@core
@alphabet.western:audio

// Sub-grammar 1: structure (ORD by default)
S -> A_r B_r A_r

-----

// Sub-grammar 2: material (random choice for each A_r and B_r)
@mode:random
A_r -> C4 D4 E4 F4
A_r -> E4 F4 G4 A4
A_r -> G4 A4 B4 C5

B_r -> G4 F4 E4 D4 C4 _
B_r -> C5 B4 A4 G4 F4 E4
